      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-12-10T07:12:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Lookup operations are supposed to increment a \"lookup count\" value (see the documentation for FileSystem::Inode) that is decremented via the \"forget\" message. In this case it appears that we\u0027re not doing it because the server is mostly stateless but I think it would still be good to explicitly document that here.",
      "revId": "6ddab6e3ef4f5fc08b84b5344bbbee5f7e348841",
